<h1><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></h1>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><i style="mso-bidi-font-style:normal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Каподастр
на 2-м ладу<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вступление:
</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'>
</span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>
– 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>.</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:3">             </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>В
моей
альтернативе
есть
логический
блок,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:3">             </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Спасающий</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> меня от
ненужных
ходов;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">    </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Некий
переносной </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>five</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>o</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>’</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>clock</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">     </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Моя
уверенность
в том, что я не
готов.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">    </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>И
когда я был
начеку,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">       </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Fm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Сигнал
был подан, и
выстрел был
дан.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
меня спасло
только то,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">       </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:2">         </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Что
я в тот
момент был
слегка пьян.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>В
моей
альтернативе
ни покрышки,
ни дна;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Я</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> правда
стою, но
непонятно на
чём.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Все
уже забыли, в
чём наша
вина,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>А я
до сих пор
уверен, что
мы ни <span class="GramE">при
чём</span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
нелепо
делать вид,
что я стою у
руля,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Когда
вокруг
столько
кармы - и <span class="SpellE">инь</span>,
и <span class="SpellE">янь</span>;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И в
самом деле,
пусть всё
течёт, как
течёт;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Ну
а я слегка
пьян.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
